Worked example on latency samples (ms): [12, 15, 18, 22, 22, 27, 31, 35, 40, 48]. Mean = Σx/n = 270/10 = **27**. Median (middle value) = **24.5**. Population std dev = **10.91**. Mean − median gap signals skew: the 48 drags the mean above the median. Rule: report center AND spread together; a mean without a spread is half a fact. Risk math and alert triage are probability: base rates decide whether a detection program works.

