**Capstone: the engagement report.** Run a full authorized penetration test against your lab network — minimum one Linux host, one Windows host, one web application, and an Active Directory lab — and deliver the professional report: executive summary (the page the board reads), methodology, findings with severity, CVSS, evidence, business impact, and remediation for each, plus a retest plan. Grade yourself on the honesty rules from the Concepts section: risk ratings at likelihood-times-impact with no inflation, every finding carrying its fix, and scope discipline documented. A finding without remediation is a complaint; access without a report is a story.

