**Capstone: the SOC shift simulation.** You are the entire SOC for a shift. Ingest a prepared alert bundle (benign noise, two true positives, one account-takeover pattern, one C2 beacon): triage the queue inside a timebox, escalate with written rationale, investigate the top escalation across three log sources, run one hypothesis-driven hunt, author the Sigma rule your hunt justifies with its tuning note, and close with a blameless lessons-learned memo. Deliverables: triage log with times, investigation timeline, the Sigma rule, the ATT&CK coverage note, and the memo. Graded on the Concepts-section disciplines: containment before eradication, memory before disk, tuned — not tolerated — false positives.

