**Capstone: the live-hunt operation.** You are the on-shift analyst when the multi-stage scenario begins: a phishing wave into M365, a clicked link with no immediate payload, then lateral movement toward the lab domain controller. Detect each stage with analytics rules you wrote, investigate across Defender XDR timelines and Purview surfaces, enrich with Graph, contain via playbook actions (verify before the DC isolation — the AI discipline applies to your own runbooks too), and deliver the incident report: timeline, blast radius, root cause, ATT&CK mapping, and remediation with owners. Then write the exam-readiness note: which SC-200 domain each capstone step exercised. Confirm current exam details on Microsoft Learn — the outline moves.

